### Test Google OAuth Flow
### Step 1: Initiate Google OAuth (open in browser)
GET http://localhost:4000/api/auth/google

### Step 2: After callback, test with received tokens
### Get current user info
GET http://localhost:4000/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

### Step 3: Refresh token
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "YOUR_REFRESH_TOKEN_HERE"
}

### Step 4: Logout
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "YOUR_REFRESH_TOKEN_HERE"
}

### Traditional Login (still works)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "YourPassword123"
}

### Register (still works)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "newuser@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePass123",
  "name": "New User"
}
